; Sample Cakewalk instrument definition (.ins) — for importer testing.
; .ins encodes ONLY names + CC maps + bank-select; no SysEx/packing/checksums/dumps.

.Patch Names

[GAIA Patches]
0=Init Patch
1=Super Saw Lead
2=Warm Pad
3=Acid Bass

.Note Names

[GAIA Drums]
36=Kick
38=Snare

.Controller Names

[GAIA Controllers]
1=Modulation
7=Volume
10=Pan
102=Tone 1 Cutoff
103=Tone 2 Cutoff
104=Tone 3 Cutoff
105=Tone 1 Resonance

.Instrument Definitions

[Roland GAIA SH-01]
Control=GAIA Controllers
Patch[*]=GAIA Patches
Key[*]=GAIA Drums
BankSelMethod=2
